# This directory is populated at build time with the aplexica-portal release
# asset pinned in packaging/portal-release.json — repository, tag, asset
# filename and SHA-256. `make fetch-portal` downloads that exact asset,
# rejects it unless the digest matches the pin, and extracts it here; the
# release workflow runs the same target before building. Bumping the portal
# is therefore a one-line reviewable diff to packaging/portal-release.json.
#
# Everything else here is gitignored (.gitignore:24-25). go:embed requires at
# least one tracked file in the directory, so this .gitkeep stays in git —
# without it a fresh checkout fails to compile before the fetch has run.
